  "summary": "The US Department of Justice said on 12 November 2026 that a court has authorised the seizure or freezing of more than 1.2 billion US dollars in cryptocurrency stolen from Binance. More than 2.7 billion dollars have already been frozen. The FBI attributes the theft to the North Korean group it calls TraderTraitor. The same DOJ release also covers a separate scheme, FaceStealer, in which fake video meetings were used to steal more than 400 million dollars over 18 months; that is not a new Binance theft.",
